     A* =================================================================
     A* File Name   : EXTRPGSUM (PF1)
     A* Description : Library Summary Metrics Physical File
     A* Format Name : EXTRPGSUMR
     A* Author      : IBM i Extraction Utility Team
     A* Columns     : Lib name / objcnt / mbrcnt / total lines / 
     A*               exec lines / non exec lines
     A* =================================================================
     A          R EXTRPGSUMR                TEXT('Library Summary Metrics')
     A            LIBNAME       10A         COLHDG('Library' 'Name')
     A            OBJCNT        10S 0       COLHDG('Source' 'Object' 'Count')
     A            MBRCNT        10S 0       COLHDG('Member' 'Count')
     A            TOTLINES      10S 0       COLHDG('Total' 'Lines')
     A            EXELINES      10S 0       COLHDG('Executable' 'Lines')
     A            NONEXELIN     10S 0       COLHDG('Non-Exec' 'Lines')
